# Repo-root ignores.
#
# A .gitignore only applies to its own directory and below. This file used to
# say secrets were "handled by the nested api/.gitignore" - they were not, and
# could not be: api/.gitignore cannot reach the root, so the root .env was
# tracked with the database, Grafana and pgAdmin passwords in it until V16-era
# cleanup. Anything at the root has to be listed HERE.

### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Logs ###
*.log

### Env ###
# The root .env feeds docker-compose (DB_PASSWORD, GRAFANA_PASSWORD,
# PGADMIN_PASSWORD). It is NOT the same file as api/.env and is not covered by
# api/.gitignore.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### Stray build output at the root ###
*.class
